    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d277">

                <pb facs="0407" n="385" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg385"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">
                    IO Files</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">United States Delegation Working Paper</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                        <lb/> US/A/3383</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1951-11-14">November 14, 1951</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">(Unofficial translation)</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Draft Resolution on the Italian Question</hi>
                    <lb/> (French Working Paper)</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The General Assembly</hi>
                </p>
                <p>In view of Resolution 310 (VIII) of the Trusteeship Council concerning the
                    position of Italy,</p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Noting</hi> that Italy has been charged by the United
                    Nations with the administration of the Trust Territory of Somaliland and that it
                    is at the present time exercising its responsibilities as Administering Power as
                    they are defined in Chapters 12 and 13 of the Charter,</p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Considering</hi> that Italy should be put in a position
                    to exercise these responsibilities with complete efficacy,</p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Believing</hi> it necessary to this end that Italy
                    become a member of the Trusteeship Council and consequently that it be admitted
                    to the United Nations,</p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Recommends</hi> to the Security Council that it take
                    urgently under consideration the present resolution with a view to recommending
                    the immediate admission of Italy as member of the United Nations.</p>
            </div>
